    "itemdesc-hardlardliquid": "Dump out a bucket full of hardened lard to acquire <a href=\"handbook://item-fat-rendered\">rendered fat</a>.",
    "item-handbooktitle-hardlardliquid": "Hardened Lard (liquid)",
    "item-handbooktext-hardlardliquid": "Liquid lard that has hardened, but is still inside of a liquid container. While holding the container, press <hk>Ctrl</hk>+<icon name='rightmousebutton'></icon> to empty it onto the ground, producing <a href=\"handbook://item-fat-rendered\">rendered fat</a>.",



