    "itemdesc-dressing-deluxe": "Rich and deep with a velvety texture, fit for a king. The key to making the ultimate salad or pasta.",
    "item-handbooktitle-dressing": "Salad Dressing",
    "item-handbooktext-dressing": "An emulsified mixture of oil and vinegar creates a <a href=\"handbook://item-expandedfoods:dressing-basic\">basic salad dressing</a> mixture. When <a href=\"handbook://kneadingmixingguide\">kneading</a> the dressing, different variants can be made with different ingredients.<br>Kneading egg white further stabilizes it and adds volume, creating <a href=\"handbook://item-expandedfoods:dressing-salad\">smooth salad dressing</a>.<br>Adding a sweetener such as honey or syrup can give the dressing a rich, deep flavor, resulting in <a href=\"handbook://item-expandedfoods:dressing-sweet\">sweet salad dressing</a>.<br>For an umami flavor, add fish or soy sauce to create <a href=\"handbook://item-expandedfoods:dressing-savory\">savory salad dressing</a>.<br>Combining all possible dressing ingredients will make the <a href=\"handbook://item-expandedfoods:dressing-deluxe\">deluxe salad dressing</a>, with the most complex flavor profile.",



